{"id":10244,"name":"decidueye-hisui","speciesId":724,"dex":724,"form":"hisuian","generation":7,"types":["grass","fighting"],"stats":{"hp":88,"attack":112,"defense":80,"special-attack":95,"special-defense":95,"speed":60},"abilities":[{"name":"overgrow","hidden":false},{"name":"scrappy","hidden":true}],"height":16,"weight":370,"baseExp":239,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10244.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10244.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10244.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10244.ogg","genus":"Arrow Quill Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"It fires arrow quills from its wings with such precision, they can pierce a pebble at distances over a hundred yards."},{"version":"moon","text":"Although basically cool and cautious, when it’s caught by surprise, it’s seized by panic."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It nocks its arrow quills and shoots them at opponents. When it simply can’t afford to miss, it tugs the vine on its head to improve its focus."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Decidueye can nock and fire an arrow at an enemy in a tenth of a second, so its battles are decided in the blink of an eye."},{"version":"sword","text":"As if wielding a bow, it launches the arrow quills hidden among the feathers of its wings. Decidueye’s shots never miss."},{"version":"shield","text":"In a tenth of a second, it can nock and fire an arrow quill, piercing an opponent’s weak point before they notice what’s happening."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"The air stored inside the rachises of Decidueye's feathers insulates the Pokémon against Hisui's extreme cold. This is firm proof that evolution can be influenced by environment."}],"genderRate":1,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["flying"],"